{
  "name": "Log Instagram DMs from Nadia to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Keep every incoming Instagram DM in a spreadsheet\n\n> **Self-hosted n8n only.** This template uses the `n8n-nodes-nadia` community node, which n8n has not verified yet. Install it first: Settings -> Community Nodes -> Install -> `n8n-nodes-nadia`.\n\nDirect messages are where the answers to a post arrive, and they are the first thing lost when an account grows. This workflow appends one row per inbound DM to a Google Sheet: who wrote, what they said, on which channel, and when.\n\nThe **Nadia Trigger** registers its own webhook on activation, so nothing has to be set up inside Nadia.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **On new DM** receives a signed `dm.received` delivery.\n2. **Flatten the DM** turns the envelope into one flat row.\n3. **Append the row** adds it to your sheet.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Add your **Nadia** credential: API key from Settings -> Developers in Nadia, host `https://app.usenadia.com/api`.\n2. Give your sheet the columns `date`, `channel`, `username`, `message`, `storyId`.\n3. Add your **Google Sheets** credential to **Append the row** and pick the spreadsheet and tab.\n4. Activate the workflow: the webhook is registered at that moment. n8n must be reachable from the internet over HTTPS.\n\n### Customize\n\nAdd `comment.received` on the trigger to log public comments in the same sheet, with an IF node before the append to separate the two.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 740
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One delivery per message\nSigned with the secret the trigger stored when it registered itself.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One row per message\nFlatten first, append second.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note2",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "dm.received"
        ],
        "channelIds": [],
        "verifySignature": true
      },
      "id": "on-new-dm",
      "name": "On new DM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-nadia.nadiaTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "nadiaApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Nadia account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "date",
              "value": "={{ $json.occurredAt }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "name": "channel",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.integrationName }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "name": "username",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.from.username }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.message.text }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "name": "storyId",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.message.storyId }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "flatten-the-dm",
      "name": "Flatten the DM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "append-the-row",
      "name": "Append the row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        700,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "On new DM": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Flatten the DM",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Flatten the DM": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Append the row",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
